  "content": "<h1>GD 工藝增強版</h1><p><strong>新增與替換合成配方，以改善遊戲體驗，並使特定工藝變得更容易或更困難。</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fprojects%252fmods%252fgd-craftsenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-WIKI-2c2c2c?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=gitbook&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"徽章 - Wiki\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/GabrielDja/GD-CraftsEnhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-SOURCE-2c2c2c?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"徽章 - 原始碼\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gd-craftsenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-CURSEFORGE-_?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=2c2c2c&amp;color=e58e0e&amp;logoColor=e58e0e\" alt=\"徽章 - 從 Curseforge 下載\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgd-craftsenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ON-MODRINTH-_?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=2c2c2c&amp;color=17b95a&amp;logoColor=17b95a\" alt=\"徽章 - 從 Modrinth 下載\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-SUPPORT-6d30fd?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"徽章 - 贊助\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabrieldjalayer.wixsite.com%252fgabrieldja-gaming-yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MY_WEBSITE-245cf3?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"徽章 - GD 團隊\"></a></p><h3>📜 授權：MIT</h3><p>此資料包由 <strong>GabrielDja</strong> 製作。</p><h3>⭐功能特色</h3><ul>\n<li>更簡單與更困難的合成配方</li>\n<li>能夠銷毀特定物品</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgabriel-djalayer.gitbook.io%252fgdteam-wiki%252fcreations%252fmods%252fgd-craftsenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wiki 目前已完整更新。</strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_f950f07717514b6bbcaaa1a644b406fa~mv2.png\" alt=\"GD 工藝增強版 - 預覽圖\"></p><h3>🛠️ 給開發者的資訊</h3><p>提供標籤供你在模組或資料包中使用！<br>\n⚠️ <strong>你的專案必須將 GD 工藝增強版設為依賴項目。</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><ul><li><code>gd_craftsenhanced:all_banner_pattern</code></li><li><code>gd_craftsenhanced:stone_slabs</code></li></ul></div><h2>✨ 合作夥伴</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.rocketnode.com%252fgabrieldja\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/31958c_568565d2774047e188ebd98b83ef588c~mv2.png\" alt=\"合作夥伴 RocketNode 橫幅 - GabrielDja\"></a></p>",
